.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-record-divergence 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-record\-divergence \- Record how far the landing loop diverged from linear over a window of runs
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten record divergence\fR [\fB\-\-ci\-workflow\fR] [\fB\-\-land\-workflow\fR] [\fB\-\-since\fR] [\fB\-\-max\-pages\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Record how far the landing loop diverged from linear over a window of runs
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-ci\-workflow\fR \fI<ci_workflow>\fR
The workflow file whose runs are the graded CI runs (default: $LAND_CI_WORKFLOW)
.TP
\fB\-\-land\-workflow\fR \fI<land_workflow>\fR
The workflow file whose runs are the landing bot\*(Aqs answers (default: $LAND_WORKFLOW)
.TP
\fB\-\-since\fR \fI<since>\fR
The window\*(Aqs start, ISO\-8601 (default: 24 hours before now)
.TP
\fB\-\-max\-pages\fR \fI<max_pages>\fR
Pages of runs to read per workflow before the window reads as truncated (default: 10)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
